OL,3,ARussell Brand is a 'sexual predator who
OL,4,Ahas no remorse', victim tells
OL,5,Asentencing hearing
OL,6,
OL,7,FRussell Brand is being sentenced for
OL,8,Frape and three counts of sexual
OL,9,Fassault, after being found guilty at
OL,10,FSouthwark Crown Court on Thursday
OL,12,FOne victim tells the court she was "in
OL,13,Fshock and turmoil... I didn't have any
OL,14,Frespect for myself"
OL,16,FAnother victim says "Russell Brand is a
OL,17,Fsexual predator who has no remorse",
OL,18,Fwhile another says she "felt powerless
OL,19,Fin that moment"
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
