OL,3,AFind out who's in the running for this
OL,4,Ayear's Booker Prize
OL,5,
OL,6,FPast Booker Prize winners Marlon James
OL,7,Fand Douglas Stuart are among the
OL,8,Fcontenders to scoop the prestigious
OL,9,Fliterary award this year, after a
OL,10,Fshortlist selection process that the
OL,11,Fjudges described as "a tussle".
OL,13,FJamaican writer James is nominated this
OL,14,Fyear for his latest novel The
OL,15,FDisappearers; while Scottish author
OL,16,FStuart is shortlisted for John of John.
OL,18,FThis year's other contenders are
OL,19,Faward-winning US novelist Elizabeth
OL,20,FStrout, and British authors M John
OL,21,FHarrison, Luke Kennard and Rebecca
OL,22,FPerry.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
